    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully playable with the Revolver.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy the &quot;Supporter Pack DLC&quot; to support my work and get more weapons to play with: Machine Gun, Bow, Carbine, Coach Gun, Repeater and Dual Pistols.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>::: STORY :::</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The outlaws aren't too happy about you jailing their leader, Sheriff.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They're all over town. Grab your six-shooter and clear them out.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>::: STRAIGHTFORWARD NON-STOP ACTION :::</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gunfight your way through procedurally generated Wild West towns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get rid of all outlaws or die trying.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>::: CUSTOMIZE GAMEPLAY MECHANICS :::</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is a bunch of options that modify different aspects of how the game mechanics work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This allows you to shape the difficulty to suit your playstyle and skill level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you want the gunfights to require hardcore skill or just be casual?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here are some examples:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What reaction time should outlaws have, and how well do they aim?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you want projectiles to be affected by gravity? Should damage account for velocity?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the amount of health you have and if it regenerates after a specified time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Should reloading be realistic, fast, or not even needed?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully playable with the Revolver.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy the &quot;Supporter Pack DLC&quot; to support my work and get more weapons to play with: Machine Gun, Bow, Carbine, Coach Gun, Repeater and Dual Pistols.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>::: STORY :::</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The outlaws aren't too happy about you jailing their leader, Sheriff.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They're all over town. Grab your six-shooter and clear them out.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>::: STRAIGHTFORWARD NON-STOP ACTION :::</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gunfight your way through procedurally generated Wild West towns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get rid of all outlaws or die trying.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>::: CUSTOMIZE GAMEPLAY MECHANICS :::</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is a bunch of options that modify different aspects of how the game mechanics work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This allows you to shape the difficulty to suit your playstyle and skill level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you want the gunfights to require hardcore skill or just be casual?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here are some examples:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What reaction time should outlaws have, and how well do they aim?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you want projectiles to be affected by gravity? Should damage account for velocity?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the amount of health you have and if it regenerates after a specified time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Should reloading be realistic, fast, or not even needed?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Gunfight your way through procedurally generated Wild West towns. Customize the gameplay mechanics to suit your playstyle. Straightforward, non-stop action.",
